    "머릿속에 떠다니는 생각을 꺼내 두면\n다음에 이어서 더 깊이 생각할 수 있어요." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Schreib auf, was dir im Kopf herumschwirrt,\nund denk beim nächsten Mal tiefer darüber nach."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Get the thoughts floating in your head out,\nand pick them up later to think deeper."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Get the thoughts floating around your head out,\nand pick them up later to think more deeply."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saca las ideas que te rondan la cabeza\ny retómalas luego para pensar más a fondo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "頭の中に浮かんでいることを書き出しておけば、\n次に続きからもっと深く考えられます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "머릿속에 떠다니는 생각을 꺼내 두면\n다음에 이어서 더 깊이 생각할 수 있어요."
          }
